tream every men's basketball game2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight March Madness games today, Saturday March 28(3) Illinois Fighting Illini vs. (9) Iowa Hawkeyes, 6:09 p.m. ET, TBS | Preview(1) Arizona Wildcats vs. (2) Purdue Boilermakers, 8:49 p.m. ET, TBS | PreviewWatch the NCAA Tournament on Sling2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 March Madness results Friday, March 27(1) Duke Blue Devils vs. (5) St. John's Red Storm | Box score(1) Michigan Wolverines vs. (4) Alabama Crimson Tide | Box score(2) Connecticut Huskies vs. (3) Michigan State Spartans | Box score(2) Iowa State Cyclones vs. (6) Tennessee Volunteers | Box scoreWatch the NCAA Tournament with a Fubo trial2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight round March Madness gamesSaturday, March 28, and Sunday, March 29.2026 NCAA tournament Final Four round March Madness games at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 6 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, TBS.March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament championship game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the Elite Eight on Sling2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.",
